{"4309500": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Tanks: Total Destruction", "steam_appid": 4309500, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>TANKS Total Destruction</strong> is a tribute to a cult classic, brought into the world of modern action games. A static top-down view (players can see the entire map), movement limited to four directions, and intense, tactical gameplay are combined with modern visuals, spectacular explosion effects, and smooth animations powered by Unreal Engine 5.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Get ready for fast-paced tank battles where reflexes, cooperation, and tactics truly matter.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game features <strong>25 diverse maps</strong> set in different environments – each battlefield offers unique layouts and challenges that keep the action fresh and engaging.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4309500/extras/501849ffc492dbfb3a9321e17d608224.avif?t=1787317439\" width=336 height=501 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Game Modes</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Single-player mode</strong> – face waves of enemies on your own</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Co-op mode</strong> – team up with another player and spread destruction (two players can play using a single keyboard)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Local multiplayer (up to 4 players)</strong> – full-scale action on a single screen, perfect for couch gaming</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Gameplay Rules</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In <strong>TANKS Total Destruction</strong>, you control a tank that can move only in four directions and always fires in the direction it is facing. The only obstacles on the map are buildings and water:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each building can be destroyed with <strong>three shots:</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4309500/extras/80cec82410b8192214fdb154b27e15b6.poster.avif?t=1787317439\" width=1170 height=630 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4309500/extras/80cec82410b8192214fdb154b27e15b6.webm?t=1787317439\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4309500/extras/80cec82410b8192214fdb154b27e15b6.mp4?t=1787317439\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Water cannot be crossed, but you can <strong>shoot through it:</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4309500/extras/5418d2076e2da4f409f1c424df52e55d.poster.avif?t=1787317439\" width=1170 height=654 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4309500/extras/5418d2076e2da4f409f1c424df52e55d.webm?t=1787317439\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4309500/extras/5418d2076e2da4f409f1c424df52e55d.mp4?t=1787317439\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No other object on the map poses an obstacle for you:</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4309500/extras/605fe379fe3d852e31aaafd9d7849dde.poster.avif?t=1787317439\" width=1170 height=654 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4309500/extras/605fe379fe3d852e31aaafd9d7849dde.webm?t=1787317439\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4309500/extras/605fe379fe3d852e31aaafd9d7849dde.mp4?t=1787317439\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There are <strong>three types of enemy tanks</strong>: normal, fast, and heavy – the heavy tank moves slower but can withstand <strong>two hits</strong>. Tactics, reflexes, and map awareness are essential to survive and defeat your enemies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Combos play a key role</strong> – eliminating multiple enemies in quick succession grants score multipliers and delivers the most satisfying moments of gameplay.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Throughout the battlefield, you will find <strong>perks</strong> that upgrade your tank.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Thanks to varied perk upgrades and unique maps, every battle demands new strategies and quick decisions – perfectly blending classic mechanics with modern design.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game will launch in <strong>Early Access in Q1 2026</strong> and will continue to be developed according to the roadmap below.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Add it to your Wishlist today.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: right\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4309500/extras/72e90732d21535d7ac42cda487112aac.avif?t=1787317439\" width=315 height=536 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4309500/extras/3bfda28875cedba6b9611f219e377b2b.avif?t=1787317439\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4309500/extras_big/3bfda28875cedba6b9611f219e377b2b.webp?t=1787317439 width=156